Pro Tip (Important)
Never type Python code directly into PowerShell like this:
Copy code

from fastapi import FastAPI
PowerShell cannot run Python syntax.
Python code goes in:
Copy code



main.py
Terminal commands are only for things like:
Copy code



pip install
uvicorn
cd




